{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41578","headline":"塞下三首 二 · 沈彬","name":"塞下三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵主和亲杀气沉，燕山闲猎鼓鼙音。\n旗分雪草偷边马，箭入寒云落塞禽。\n陇月尽牵乡思动，战衣谁寄泪痕深。\n金钗谩作封侯别，劈破佳人万里心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}